    Discovered during F-New-Run-On-Step verification (Iteration
    2c.1): the new Run-Node's page rendered as a generic
    "Untitled" with no indication it was a Run. Hoisting the
    chips closes that gap and applies to all supertag types
    (not Step / Run specific).
  req F-Supertag-Chips-On-Page-Header.1:
    when: the Article surface renders a page Node that carries
      any supertags
    then: `TagChips` is rendered between the PageHeader (H1) and
      FieldGroups, showing one chip per supertag, with the same
      F-Supertag chip-gestures (click → zoom into the tag-Node,
