```mdl
test T-Supertag-open-control-click: clicking the open-instance control opens the typed instance in the current pane
  given: a bullet N tagged with supertag `#T` (e.g. `#Agent`,
    which represents an ECHO type registering a dedicated
    Composer article surface like AgentArticle); deck mode
