```mdl
test T-Supertag-open-control-shift-click-pane: shift-clicking the open-instance control opens the typed instance in a new pane
  given: a bullet N tagged with supertag `#T` (e.g. `#Agent`);
    the outliner is visible in a pane; deck mode is enabled
  when: I shift-click the open-instance control on this
    bullet
  then:
