  given: a Bramble graph with at least one bullet; plugin-bramble registered with the Bramble.Run schema
  when: user places cursor in a bullet and types `#run`
  then:
    - the supertag picker opens and narrows to "Run"
    - "Run" is offered as a tag option
    - selecting "Run" creates a fresh typed Run instance per T-Supertag-picker-creates-fresh-instance
    - the bullet renders a `#Run` chip per F-Supertag chip semantics
